 API Endpoints
Health Check
text
GET /api/health
Response: { status: 'OK', time: 'ISO timestamp', environment: 'production' }
Inventory
text
GET    /api/items              # List all items
GET    /api/items/:id          # Get single item
POST   /api/items              # Create new item
PUT    /api/items/:id          # Update item
DELETE /api/items/:id          # Delete item
GET    /api/items/low-stock    # Get items below threshold
Sellers
text
GET    /api/sellers            # List all sellers
GET    /api/sellers/:id        # Get seller with debt summary
POST   /api/sellers            # Create new seller
PUT    /api/sellers/:id        # Update seller
DELETE /api/sellers/:id        # Delete seller
GET    /api/sellers/:id/debt   # Get detailed debt breakdown
Consignments (Handovers)
text
POST   /api/consignments/handover    # Give items to seller
POST   /api/consignments/return      # Return items from seller
PUT    /api/consignments/:id/sold    # Report items sold
GET    /api/consignments/active      # Get all active consignments
GET    /api/consignments/overdue     # Get overdue consignments
Payments
text
POST   /api/payments            # Record payment (auto FIFO allocation)
GET    /api/payments/seller/:id # Get all payments for a seller
GET    /api/payments/daily      # Get today's payments summary